  "band_lo_in_bins": 1.528,
  "what_it_measures": "band_metrics is NOT a spectral line. It (1) makes a 70-sample Hann STFT, (2) sums S^2 over the band bins to get a band-energy-vs-time envelope g(t), (3) FFTs g(t) and takes an UNCONSTRAINED argmax over 40-400 Hz. So beat_hz is the ENVELOPE beat of whatever the band bins contain.",
  "why_it_leaks": "The band's lower edge, 430 Hz, is only 1.53 bins from DC while a 70-sample Hann window's main lobe reaches 2.00 bins (563 Hz). The band therefore sits INSIDE the main lobe / first sidelobes of the strong zero-Doppler body line, and inherits its amplitude modulation whether or not any Doppler energy exists there.",
